{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723530/extras/44c05e427d3a4509515c0f65ab002f47.avif?t=1756381647\" data-has-big width=1600 height=278 /></span><strong>Welcome to\u00a0<i>Clarity</i>\u2122</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paperwork is a game about corporate growth.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong>\u00a0the office of <i>Clarity</i>\u2122 as you join and the company to lead a new division towards profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong>\u00a0<strong>and place</strong> desks of various kinds, supports and meeting rooms to increase the office productivity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimize</strong>\u00a0your income using different synergies between adjacent desks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow</strong>\u00a0grow and grow!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Clarity</i>\u2122 is expecting big from you and you are not letting us down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723530/extras/bdb3aa3b26d1543c780cbe0f2775de11.poster.avif?t=1756381647\" width=1400 height=784 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723530/extras/bdb3aa3b26d1543c780cbe0f2775de11.webm?t=1756381647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723530/extras/bdb3aa3b26d1543c780cbe0f2775de11.mp4?t=1756381647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.